msgid "软件包与证书"
msgstr "Packages and Certificates"

msgid "命令行"
msgstr "Command Line"

msgid ""
"系统使用真实的上游 apk 命令、数据库、签名和依赖关系。 只读查询无需把桌面作为 root 启动；修改系统包通常需要管理员权限。 在 ReliefOS"
" 终端中可使用::"
msgstr ""
"The system uses the real upstream apk command, database, signatures, and "
"dependencies. Read-only queries do not require running the desktop as root; "
"modifying system packages usually requires administrator privileges. In a "
"ReliefOS terminal, use::"

msgid ""
"软件源位于 ``/etc/apk/repositories``，world 和公钥按 apk 的标准路径管理。 不要为解决包冲突删除仍在使用的 "
"libc、认证或基础包，也不要关闭签名验证。 外部软件存在 Linux ABI 依赖，安装成功不代表全部功能已验证。"
msgstr ""
"Repositories are configured in ``/etc/apk/repositories``; world and public "
"keys use standard apk paths. Do not resolve package conflicts by deleting "
"libc, authentication, or base packages still in use, or by disabling "
"signature verification. External software has Linux ABI dependencies; "
"successful installation does not mean every feature has been verified."

msgid ""
"基础命令由完整的 ``reliefos-coreutils`` GNU 包与 BusyBox 按路径分工提供。 同名外部命令使用 GNU 入口，旧路径由"
" APK 管理并转发；详情与验收方法见 :doc:`coreutils`。"
msgstr ""
"Basic commands are supplied by the complete GNU ``reliefos-coreutils`` "
"package and BusyBox, divided by path. External commands with overlapping "
"names use GNU entry points; APK manages and forwards legacy paths. For "
"details and acceptance procedures, see :doc:`coreutils`."

msgid "基础依赖"
msgstr "Base Dependencies"

msgid ""
"sl、ncurses、zlib、libpng、SQLite、mbedTLS 3 由签名 Alpine APK 提供。 "
"系统直接请求官方命令、终端工具/数据和 SQLite 命令/运行库，不再生成本地包装包。 文件所有权可通过 ``apk info --who-owns "
"/usr/bin/sl``、``/usr/bin/tput``、``/usr/lib/libsqlite3.so.0`` 查询。 "
"离线更新器在预检时将旧包装包的 world 请求转换为官方包，保留其他包和配置； 正式事务自动卸载旧包，完成后清除离线缓存中的旧包装包归档。 "
"新的自有包使用第 6 代版本前缀，保证从第 2、3、4、5 代包按正常版本顺序升级。 旧的 ``sqlite.so.3`` ABI 已移除。 依赖旧自定义 "
"SQLite VFS 或厂商内部符号的外部程序需要重新编译。"
msgstr ""
"sl, ncurses, zlib, libpng, SQLite, and mbedTLS 3 are supplied by signed "
"Alpine APKs. The system requests official commands, terminal tools/data, and"
" SQLite commands/runtime libraries directly, no longer generating local "
"wrapper packages. Query file ownership with ``apk info --who-owns "
"/usr/bin/sl``, ``/usr/bin/tput``, and ``/usr/lib/libsqlite3.so.0``. During "
"preflight, the offline updater converts old wrapper-package world requests "
"to official packages while preserving other packages and configuration. The "
"actual transaction automatically removes old packages; afterward it clears "
"their wrapper archives from the offline cache. New project-owned packages "
"use a sixth-generation version prefix to upgrade normally from second-, "
"third-, fourth-, and fifth-generation packages. The old ``sqlite.so.3`` ABI has been removed. "
"External programs depending on the old custom SQLite VFS or vendor-internal "
"symbols must be rebuilt."

msgid "libbsd、dosfstools、e2fsprogs 及其运行库和文档也直接使用锁定的官方 Alpine APK。 ext2/3/4 和 FAT 工具保留官方 ``/sbin`` 路径，旧 ``/usr/sbin`` 入口由兼容链接转发。 本地认证支持包继续提供 libmd，本地文件系统包继续提供 exfatprogs；它们通过真实的 APK 依赖安装已迁移的官方包，升级事务同时转移旧文件的所有权，不强制覆盖文件。 shadow 构建使用独立提取的 libbsd 开发文件，不把 Alpine 的 Linux 头文件混入 SDK。"
msgstr "libbsd, dosfstools, e2fsprogs, and their runtime libraries and documentation also come directly from pinned official Alpine APKs. The ext2/3/4 and FAT tools retain their official ``/sbin`` paths; compatibility links forward older ``/usr/sbin`` entry points. The local authentication support package still supplies libmd, and the local filesystem package still supplies exfatprogs. Real APK dependencies install the migrated official packages, transferring ownership of old files in the same upgrade transaction without forced overwrites. Shadow builds use separately extracted libbsd development files, keeping Alpine Linux headers out of the SDK."

msgid "util-linux 2.42.4 的命令、运行库和手册由锁定的官方 Alpine edge APK 提供。 分区和文件系统工具保留官方 ``/sbin`` 路径，mount、umount、lsblk 保留 ``/bin`` 路径； 旧入口通过单向兼容链接转发。exfatprogs 的开发依赖从官方 APK 单独提取，运行镜像不包含 这份开发根。现有 shadow login、newgrp、nologin 和 PAM 策略由本地认证包明确接管重叠文件， 官方包保留 su、runuser 的文件归属和权限。"
msgstr "The util-linux 2.42.4 commands, runtime libraries, and manuals come from pinned official Alpine edge APKs. Partition and filesystem tools retain their official ``/sbin`` paths; mount, umount, and lsblk retain their ``/bin`` paths. One-way compatibility links forward older entry points. Development dependencies for exfatprogs are extracted separately from official APKs; this development root is excluded from runtime images. The local authentication package explicitly owns overlapping files for the existing shadow login, newgrp, nologin, and PAM policy. Official packages retain ownership and permissions of su and runuser."

msgid "liblastlog2 依赖 SQLite 运行库，因此桌面和控制台基础系统均保留 sqlite-libs； SQLite 命令仍由组件开关控制。"
msgstr "liblastlog2 depends on the SQLite runtime library, so both desktop and console base systems retain sqlite-libs. The SQLite command remains controlled by its component option."

msgid "官方 lsblk 2.42.4-r3 的直接探测路径未请求文件系统版本，因此 ``FSVER`` 列可能为空。 本版保留该原版行为；读取真实版本可使用::"
msgstr "The direct probing path in official lsblk 2.42.4-r3 does not request the filesystem version, so the ``FSVER`` column may be empty. This release preserves that upstream behavior. To read the actual version, use::"

msgid ""
"RPR 本地发布树继续包含完整的签名索引、原始上游 APK 和自有包，构建 ``rpr-pages`` 不等于部署到线上。运行库因新增 ELF "
"NEEDED 而得到真实 APK 依赖，不能只复制新的 ``libreliefos.so.2`` 而遗漏配套库。"
msgstr ""
"The local RPR publication tree still contains complete signed indexes, "
"original upstream APKs, and project-owned packages; building ``rpr-pages`` "
"does not deploy it online. New ELF NEEDED entries give runtime libraries "
"real APK dependencies; do not copy only a new ``libreliefos.so.2`` while "
"omitting its companion libraries."

msgid "内核与模块更新"
msgstr "Kernel and Module Updates"

msgid ""
"``reliefos-kernel`` APK 同时拥有版本化的内核、initramfs、模块树和校验清单。 ``reliefos-grub`` "
"提供静态引导维护工具和标准 APK commit hook；内核包依赖 同一包版本的引导工具，包脚本调用共同的完整载荷发布接口。 不要手工替换 ESP "
"上的单个 ``kernel.sys``，或把其他内核的模块复制到当前目录。"
msgstr ""
"The ``reliefos-kernel`` APK owns the versioned kernel, initramfs, module "
"tree, and checksum manifests together. ``reliefos-grub`` supplies static "
"boot maintenance tools and the standard APK commit hook. The kernel package "
"depends on boot tools of the same package version, and package scripts call "
"the common complete-payload publication interface. Do not manually replace "
"an individual ``kernel.sys`` on the ESP or copy another kernel's modules "
"into the current directory."

msgid "使用 RPR 时::"
msgstr "When using RPR::"

msgid ""
"检查依据是已安装 APK 的版本，发行数字版本相同时的包修订也可识别。 ``--force`` 可重试或修复当前签名版本，不改变 world "
"中普通包名的请求形式。 客户端只接受格式 4：先冻结并验证签名仓库索引，解析依赖，验证全部归档， 在私有目录解包并核对内核、initramfs、模块 "
"ABI 和完整清单，再执行 APK 事务；不从网络自动导入新的信任公钥，也不关闭 TLS 或签名验证。"
msgstr ""
"Checks are based on installed APK versions, including package revisions with"
" the same numeric release version. ``--force`` retries or repairs the "
"current signed version without changing ordinary package-name requests in "
"world. The client accepts format 4 only: it freezes and verifies the signed "
"repository index, resolves dependencies, verifies all archives, extracts "
"them into a private directory, and checks the kernel, initramfs, module ABI,"
" and complete manifest before running the APK transaction. It neither "
"imports new trusted public keys automatically from the network nor disables "
"TLS or signature verification."

msgid ""
"日常升级通过预分配的 A/B 引导记录发布不可变的成对载荷，保留旧选择记录。 标准 pre-commit hook 在 APK "
"删除旧包文件前保留独立副本；早期静态恢复工具 可在中断升级后、正常共享库和模块服务运行前恢复当前启动版本的产品。 "
"发布完成后重启才切换正在运行的内核。旧模块、旧入口和用户树外模块不会因 升级而被批量删除；本版不自动清理已保留的历史内核。"
msgstr ""
"Routine upgrades publish immutable paired payloads through preallocated A/B "
"boot records while preserving old selection records. A standard pre-commit "
"hook retains independent copies before APK deletes old package files. Early "
"static recovery tools can restore artifacts for the currently booted version"
" after an interrupted upgrade, before normal shared libraries and module "
"services run. The running kernel changes only after reboot following "
"publication. Upgrades do not bulk-delete old modules, old entries, or "
"modules outside the user tree; this version does not automatically prune "
"retained historical kernels."

msgid ""
"缺少新的稳定 GRUB 选择脚本或内核包记录的旧安装，需要先使用匹配的安装器 介质完成引导资源迁移；客户端会在 APK 修改根文件系统前拒绝半套更新。 "
"仅有旧格式 1、2、3 的 RPR 也会被明确拒绝。 模块配置与日常管理见 :doc:`kernel-modules`。"
msgstr ""
"Old installations lacking the new stable GRUB selector script or kernel "
"package records must first migrate boot resources using matching installer "
"media. The client rejects partial updates before APK modifies the root "
"filesystem. RPR repositories offering only old formats 1, 2, or 3 are also "
"explicitly rejected. For module configuration and routine administration, "
"see :doc:`kernel-modules`."

msgid "ReliefAPK"
msgstr "ReliefAPK"

msgid ""
"ReliefAPK 是 apk 的原生 C++/FLTK 前端，提供包查询、安装、删除、升级、 "
"修复及仓库配置等入口。应用修改前先审阅计划和输出；长任务在子进程执行。 普通用户可在程序内通过已有 sudo/root 认证流程执行特权事务。 "
"取消、认证失败或 apk 失败必须保留明确状态，不能把退出码或空输出当成成功。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefAPK is a native C++/FLTK frontend for apk, providing package queries, "
"installation, removal, upgrades, repair, and repository configuration. "
"Review plans and output before applying changes; long tasks run in child "
"processes. Regular users can perform privileged transactions through the "
"existing sudo/root authentication flow within the application. Cancellation,"
" authentication failure, and apk failure must retain explicit status; "
"neither an exit code nor empty output should simply be assumed to mean "
"success."

msgid "信任与更新"
msgstr "Trust and Updates"

msgid ""
"自建系统的签名私钥保存在宿主用户目录，不属于发行内容。升级要沿用目标 系统已信任的公钥；更换密钥需要独立、经认证的轮换流程，不能从更新介质自动信任。"
msgstr ""
"Signing private keys for self-built systems are stored in the host user's "
"directory and are not distributed. Upgrades must use public keys already "
"trusted by the target system. Replacing keys requires a separate "
"authenticated rotation process; update media must not be trusted "
"automatically."

msgid ""
"ReliefMail 的证书修复通过 ReliefAPK 预览并更新 ``ca-certificates`` 和 ``ca-certificates-"
"bundle``。损坏的安全常规文件可先备份并恢复出厂 CA； 修复仍须检查签名、TLS、权限和最终证书内容。不要关闭域名、有效期或证书链验证。 "
"生成目录 ``/etc/ssl/certs`` 与管理员自定义源、apk 保护规则需人工协调。 细节见 "
":doc:`../applications/reliefmail`。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefMail certificate repair previews and updates ``ca-certificates`` and "
"``ca-certificates-bundle`` through ReliefAPK. Corrupted regular files with "
"safe permissions can first be backed up and restored to factory CA contents."
" Repair must still verify signatures, TLS, permissions, and the final "
"certificate contents. Do not disable hostname, validity-period, or "
"certificate-chain validation. The generated ``/etc/ssl/certs`` directory, "
"administrator-defined sources, and apk protection rules require manual "
"coordination. For details, see :doc:`../applications/reliefmail`."
